name 'aif-y2-ai-at-scale-postassessment-q6-2026'

right 'More problems raise the prediction, and more sleep lowers it.'
wrong 'More problems lower the prediction, and more sleep raises it.'
wrong 'More problems and more sleep both raise the prediction.'
wrong 'More problems and more sleep both lower the prediction.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

markdown <<MARKDOWN
In a simple neural network that predicts how many minutes a student will need to finish their homework, each input connects directly to the output. The input “number of problems” has a weight of 4, and the input “hours of sleep last night” has a weight of -2. Which statement best describes how these inputs affect the output?
MARKDOWN

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 5: Neural Networks
MARKDOWN
